   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The Karner blue butterfly larva secretes a carbohydrate, which is a source of energy for ants. In turn, ants tend to the larva, increasing its likelihood to grow into an adult butterfly. Make a claim for what type of interaction this represents.",
